# Client (`src/frontend/client/`)

P0 rules: root `AGENTS.md` §4 (Client column).

- Tests: `npx jest <files> --coverage=false --watchAll=false` (cwd `src/frontend/client/`). `npm test` runs jest in watch mode; do not use it from an agent.
- Do not enable coverage for all of `src/`; `jest.config.cjs` instruments by default and writes `coverage/`.
- Locales: `src/locales/{en,zh-Hans,ja}/translation.json`; use the `/i18n-localizer` skill for new keys.